{"page":168,"width":1769,"height":2839,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"222","words":[{"text":"222","x":188,"y":165,"width":62,"height":32}]},{"text":"Chapter 5 CPU 스케줍렇","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":329,"y":167,"width":128,"height":29},{"text":"5","x":472,"y":167,"width":22,"height":23},{"text":"CPU","x":527,"y":168,"width":57,"height":23},{"text":"스케줍렇","x":595,"y":165,"width":93,"height":27}]},{"text":"버스트 지속시간","words":[{"text":"버스트","x":831,"y":893,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"지속시간","x":914,"y":892,"width":101,"height":30}]},{"text":"그림 5.2 CPU 버스트 지속시간의 히스토그램","words":[{"text":"그림","x":712,"y":975,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"5.2","x":775,"y":977,"width":42,"height":26},{"text":"CPU","x":850,"y":976,"width":61,"height":26},{"text":"버스트","x":924,"y":974,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"지속시간의","x":1014,"y":972,"width":134,"height":32},{"text":"히스토그램","x":1161,"y":970,"width":138,"height":32}]},{"text":"생할때)","words":[{"text":"생할때)","x":421,"y":1118,"width":123,"height":42}]},{"text":"3. 프로세스가 대기 상태에서 준비 완료 상태로 전환될 때(예를 들어, I/O의 종료 시)","words":[{"text":"3.","x":367,"y":1189,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"프로세스가","x":419,"y":1183,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"대기","x":601,"y":1183,"width":61,"height":40},{"text":"상태에서","x":678,"y":1184,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"준비","x":824,"y":1184,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"완료","x":903,"y":1183,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"상태로","x":983,"y":1182,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"전환될","x":1101,"y":1181,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"때(예를","x":1219,"y":1180,"width":122,"height":43},{"text":"들어,","x":1352,"y":1180,"width":84,"height":40},{"text":"I/O의","x":1450,"y":1179,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"종료","x":1573,"y":1181,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"시)","x":1654,"y":1182,"width":37,"height":44}]},{"text":"4. 프로세스가종료할 때","words":[{"text":"4.","x":366,"y":1254,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"프로세스가종료할","x":419,"y":1249,"width":281,"height":39},{"text":"때","x":712,"y":1249,"width":29,"height":39}]},{"text":"상황 1과4의 경우, 스케줄링 면에서는 선택의 여지가 없다. 실행을 위해 새로운 프로세","words":[{"text":"상황","x":334,"y":1380,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"1과4의","x":416,"y":1380,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"경우,","x":549,"y":1381,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"스케줄링","x":636,"y":1381,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"면에서는","x":786,"y":1380,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"선택의","x":934,"y":1380,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"여지가","x":1053,"y":1380,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"없다.","x":1173,"y":1380,"width":76,"height":39},{"text":"실행을","x":1267,"y":1379,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"위해","x":1392,"y":1379,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"새로운","x":1480,"y":1379,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"프로세","x":1601,"y":1383,"width":91,"height":40}]},{"text":"스(준비 큐에 하나라도 존재할 경우)가 반드시 선택되어야 한다. 그러나 상황 2와 3을 위","words":[{"text":"스(준비","x":334,"y":1446,"width":110,"height":42},{"text":"큐에","x":460,"y":1446,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"하나라도","x":538,"y":1446,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"존재할","x":684,"y":1447,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"경우)가","x":799,"y":1446,"width":115,"height":42},{"text":"반드시","x":925,"y":1446,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"선택되어야","x":1041,"y":1446,"width":177,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":1230,"y":1446,"width":80,"height":40},{"text":"그러나","x":1325,"y":1446,"width":112,"height":40},{"text":"상황","x":1449,"y":1445,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"2와","x":1536,"y":1445,"width":58,"height":38},{"text":"3을","x":1604,"y":1446,"width":52,"height":38},{"text":"위","x":1668,"y":1449,"width":24,"height":39}]},{"text":"해서는 선택의 여지가 있다.","words":[{"text":"해서는","x":336,"y":1512,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"선택의","x":449,"y":1512,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"여지가","x":561,"y":1513,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":674,"y":1513,"width":72,"height":39}]},{"text":"상황 1과 4에서만 스케줄링이 발생할 경우, 우리는 이러한 스케줄링 방법을 비선점","words":[{"text":"상황","x":399,"y":1578,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"1과","x":480,"y":1578,"width":53,"height":40},{"text":"4에서만","x":544,"y":1579,"width":122,"height":40},{"text":"스케줄링이","x":679,"y":1578,"width":164,"height":40},{"text":"발생할","x":861,"y":1577,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"경우,","x":980,"y":1578,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"우리는","x":1072,"y":1579,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"이러한","x":1195,"y":1579,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"스케줄링","x":1317,"y":1578,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"방법을","x":1480,"y":1577,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"비선점","x":1604,"y":1577,"width":88,"height":41}]},{"text":"(nonpreemptive) 또는 협조적(cooperative)이라고 한다. 그렇지 않으면, 그것은 선점","words":[{"text":"(nonpreemptive)","x":339,"y":1648,"width":282,"height":43},{"text":"또는","x":635,"y":1647,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"협조적(cooperative)이라고","x":716,"y":1645,"width":436,"height":45},{"text":"한다.","x":1165,"y":1645,"width":79,"height":39},{"text":"그렇지","x":1261,"y":1645,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"않으면,","x":1385,"y":1644,"width":118,"height":40},{"text":"그것은","x":1518,"y":1642,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"선점","x":1637,"y":1643,"width":55,"height":40}]},{"text":"(preemptive)이라고 한다. 비선점 스케줄링하에서는, 일단 CPU가 한 프로세스에 할당","words":[{"text":"(preemptive)이라고","x":341,"y":1711,"width":318,"height":47},{"text":"한다.","x":670,"y":1711,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"비선점","x":761,"y":1710,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"스케줄링하에서는,","x":872,"y":1710,"width":286,"height":40},{"text":"일단","x":1176,"y":1710,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"CPU가","x":1257,"y":1710,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"한","x":1395,"y":1710,"width":39,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1445,"y":1708,"width":177,"height":39},{"text":"할당","x":1637,"y":1709,"width":59,"height":39}]},{"text":"되면 프로세스가 종료하든지, 또는 대기 상태로 전환해 CPU를 방출할 때까지 점유한다.","words":[{"text":"되면","x":343,"y":1778,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":419,"y":1777,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"종료하든지,","x":594,"y":1776,"width":177,"height":41},{"text":"또는","x":784,"y":1778,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"대기","x":864,"y":1776,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"상태로","x":942,"y":1776,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"전환해","x":1060,"y":1776,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"CPU를","x":1177,"y":1777,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"방출할","x":1313,"y":1776,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"때까지","x":1438,"y":1774,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"점유한다.","x":1561,"y":1773,"width":134,"height":40}]},{"text":"Windows, macOS, Linux 및 UNIX를 포함한 거의 모든 최신 운영체제들은 선점 스","words":[{"text":"Windows,","x":341,"y":1847,"width":170,"height":35},{"text":"macOS,","x":525,"y":1847,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"Linux","x":667,"y":1848,"width":99,"height":30},{"text":"및","x":783,"y":1843,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"UNIX를","x":827,"y":1843,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"포함한","x":978,"y":1841,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"거의","x":1097,"y":1841,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"모든","x":1180,"y":1843,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"최신","x":1269,"y":1841,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"운영체제들은","x":1354,"y":1839,"width":223,"height":41},{"text":"선점","x":1592,"y":1838,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"스","x":1668,"y":1842,"width":28,"height":29}]},{"text":"게줄링 알고리즘을 시용한다.","words":[{"text":"게줄링","x":345,"y":1909,"width":93,"height":40},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":455,"y":1909,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"시용한다.","x":629,"y":1909,"width":140,"height":40}]},{"text":"불행하게도 선점 스케줄링은 데이터가 다수의 프로세스에 의해 공유될 때 경쟁 조건","words":[{"text":"불행하게도","x":405,"y":1974,"width":165,"height":40},{"text":"선점","x":582,"y":1974,"width":61,"height":40},{"text":"스케줄링은","x":659,"y":1975,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"데이터가","x":839,"y":1973,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"다수의","x":986,"y":1972,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1101,"y":1971,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"의해","x":1294,"y":1971,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"공유될","x":1380,"y":1970,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"때","x":1507,"y":1970,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"경쟁","x":1557,"y":1969,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"조건","x":1638,"y":1970,"width":57,"height":38}]},{"text":"을 사할 수 있다. 두 프로세스가 자료를 공유하는 경우를 고려하자. 한 프로세스가 자","words":[{"text":"을","x":344,"y":2042,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"사할","x":390,"y":2040,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":502,"y":2041,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":551,"y":2040,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":637,"y":2043,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스가","x":684,"y":2039,"width":167,"height":40},{"text":"자료를","x":864,"y":2039,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"공유하는","x":978,"y":2038,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"경우를","x":1133,"y":2037,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"고려하자.","x":1253,"y":2036,"width":155,"height":39},{"text":"한","x":1427,"y":2037,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1480,"y":2034,"width":178,"height":40},{"text":"자","x":1669,"y":2035,"width":28,"height":40}]},{"text":"료를 갱신하고 있는 동안 선점되어 두 번째 프로세스가 실행 가능한 상태가 될 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"료를","x":344,"y":2108,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"갱신하고","x":425,"y":2106,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"있는","x":571,"y":2106,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"동안","x":646,"y":2106,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"선점되어","x":728,"y":2105,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":872,"y":2107,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"번째","x":922,"y":2104,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1001,"y":2103,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"실행","x":1190,"y":2102,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"가능한","x":1276,"y":2102,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"상태가","x":1401,"y":2101,"width":115,"height":40},{"text":"될","x":1530,"y":2101,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1580,"y":2101,"width":37,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1633,"y":2101,"width":63,"height":40}]},{"text":"이때 두 번째 프로세스가 데이터를 읽으려고 할 때, 데이터의 일관성은 이미 깨진 상태","words":[{"text":"이때","x":347,"y":2173,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":425,"y":2174,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"번째","x":474,"y":2171,"width":61,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스가","x":552,"y":2171,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"데이터를","x":732,"y":2171,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"읽으려고","x":880,"y":2169,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"할","x":1027,"y":2169,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1077,"y":2169,"width":41,"height":39},{"text":"데이터의","x":1137,"y":2168,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"일관성은","x":1298,"y":2168,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"이미","x":1463,"y":2167,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"깨진","x":1553,"y":2167,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"상태","x":1637,"y":2167,"width":57,"height":40}]},{"text":"이다. 이러한 문제에 대해 6장에서 상세하게 논의할 것이다.","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":347,"y":2238,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"이러한","x":434,"y":2237,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"문제에","x":542,"y":2237,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"대해","x":654,"y":2237,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"6장에서","x":729,"y":2236,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"상세하게","x":859,"y":2234,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"논의할","x":1004,"y":2234,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":1122,"y":2234,"width":111,"height":40}]},{"text":"선점은 또한 운영체제 커널 설계에 영향을 준다. 시스템 콜을 처리할 동안, 커널은","words":[{"text":"선점은","x":409,"y":2303,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"또한","x":521,"y":2303,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"운영체제","x":601,"y":2301,"width":129,"height":40},{"text":"커널","x":750,"y":2301,"width":61,"height":40},{"text":"설계에","x":829,"y":2301,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"영향을","x":946,"y":2300,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"준다.","x":1059,"y":2300,"width":77,"height":40},{"text":"시스템","x":1156,"y":2299,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"콜을","x":1278,"y":2299,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"처리할","x":1372,"y":2299,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"동안,","x":1501,"y":2299,"width":83,"height":40},{"text":"커널은","x":1604,"y":2298,"width":92,"height":40}]},{"text":"한 프로세스를 위한 활동으로 바쁠 수 있다. 그러한 활동은(I/O 큐와 같은) 중요한 커널","words":[{"text":"한","x":346,"y":2370,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스를","x":392,"y":2369,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"위한","x":569,"y":2368,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"활동으로","x":645,"y":2368,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"바쁠","x":789,"y":2367,"width":66,"height":39},{"tex